OL,3,GNEWSASoldier who came to sick driver's
OL,4,Aaid commended
OL,5,
OL,6,FA soldier who stopped to help a woman
OL,7,Fwho was seriously ill in her car has
OL,8,Fsaid he "really didn't expect" to
OL,9,Freceive a commendation from his
OL,10,Fcommander.
OL,12,FPte Dan Montgomery was awarded the
OL,13,FCatterick Garrison Commander's
OL,14,FCommendation for going to the aid of
OL,15,Fthe stricken driver, the Ministry of
OL,16,FDefence (MoD) said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
