OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASoldier who came to sick driver's
OL,4,Aaid commended
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter spotting the woman while driving
OL,7,Fbetween camps, he called the emergency
OL,8,Fservices, contacted her family, moved
OL,9,Fher off the busy road and stayed with
OL,10,Fher for more than two hours until
OL,11,Fparamedics arrived.
OL,13,FThe 33-year-old, from Rotherham, said:
OL,14,F"If you're in a position and are able
OL,15,Fto help somebody, you should. If
OL,16,Feverybody helped each other a bit more,
OL,17,Fthe world would be a better place."
